      "title": "Frontend Client (React 19 + TypeScript)",
      "items": [
        "Polygon drawing canvas & urban corridor presets powered by OpenStreetMap, CartoDB & Esri basemaps",
        "Analysis dashboard with 4 specialized tabs: Overview KPIs, HCM 6th LOS speed gradients, Civil recommendations, and SUMO simulation",
        "5 FPS playback loop animating real-time speed-coded vehicle markers and dynamic traffic signal phase states"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "FastAPI Backend & Geospatial Analytics",
      "items": [
        "OSMnx road graph extraction with WGS84 geodesic calculations and physical segment deduplication",
        "NetworkX betweenness centrality identifies structural intersection bottlenecks across the corridor",
        "Data ingestion engine correlates TomTom Flow & Incidents feeds with OpenWeather microclimate telemetry",
        "Evidence-based recommendation engine produces prioritized civil interventions with mandatory civil engineering review notices"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "SUMO Microscopic Simulation Subsystem",
      "items": [
        "Compiles UTM-projected XML networks, routes, and demand through Eclipse SUMO netconvert",
        "Dual independent execution: Optimized Scenario (Actuated Adaptive Signal Control) vs Baseline Scenario (Pre-Timed / Priority)",
        "TraCI socket client manages live signal actuation with automatic fallback to polyline 2D kinematics when SUMO binary is absent",
        "Cumulative edge telemetry evaluates post-simulation road-level congestion scores with zero synthetic multipliers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Storage Layer & Persistence Hygiene",
      "items": [
        "Durable local persistence using SQLite (backend/data/gativa.db) for analyses, traffic flow, OSM cache, and candidate decisions",
        "Optional MongoDB connection with graceful, automatic fallback to in-memory session dictionaries",
        "Strict data provenance tracking: source_verified (OSM tags), source_inferred, and simulation_assumption"
      ]
    }
  ]
